    {
      "id": "dom-4d4c2313",
      "text": "romi 是单 Hub、多 Agent 的 Linux 主机监测服务。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p.doc-lead:nth-of-type(2)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-4c9c57f4",
      "text": "资源与历史",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-1",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-d16ff50a",
      "text": "Agent 上报 CPU、物理内存、ZRAM、Swap、磁盘、网络、进程数、连接数和运行时长。Hub 保存分钟与小时历史；缺少样本的区间保持空白。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-ac694158",
      "text": "监测与通知",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-2",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-127f04f0",
      "text": "TCP 监测使用 host:port 目标，可指定执行节点和间隔。管理员可配置 Telegram、Webhook、离线恢复、流量与到期通知。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(4)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-f9fd5748",
      "text": "公开状态页",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-3",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-b21a3c03",
      "text": "公开页默认关闭，新节点默认公开。匿名页面可查看允许公开的节点和历史，但不返回管理地址、备注或凭据。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(5)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
